OL,3,GNEWSABus diversions due to anti-social
OL,4,Abehaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus operator has announced temporary
OL,7,Fevening diversions in part of Newcastle
OL,8,Fdue to persistent anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour.
OL,11,FStagecoach said nine services will be
OL,12,Fdiverted from 18:30 BST until the end
OL,13,Fof service in Blakelaw.
OL,15,FOperations manager Colin Newbury said:
OL,16,F"We have a responsibility to take
OL,17,Fappropriate action where there is a
OL,18,Fcredible risk to the safety and
OL,19,Fwellbeing of our colleagues, customers
OL,20,For vehicles."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
